sequenceDiagram
    %% an upload through a connected server, with its timeout
    participant cli as CLI
    participant local as Local daemon
    participant remote as Connected server
    cli->>local: upload a file
    local->>+remote: POST with the bearer token
    alt answered in time
        remote-->>-local: 201
        local-->>cli: stored
    else no answer for 30 s
        local--xremote: abort
        local-->>cli: timed out, nothing stored
    end
